  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rooted in the Global South, Avina Americas drives collaborative processes on the local, regional, and global level that involve diverse stakeholders; integrate social, technological, and business innovations; and actively promote the leadership of the most vulnerable sectors of society to effect systemic changes in democratic innovation, climate action, and just and regenerative economy. Avina aims to scale up its support to emerging Mexican civil society in strengthening democracy and expanding civic space. (Strategy: Inclusive Governance)</narrative>
  </description>
